  "prefLabel": "Ins 6001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 6001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the provisions of RSA 415-A to standardize and simplify the terms and coverages of individual ancillary health insurance policies, group ancillary health policies and certificates, and blanket policies and certificates providing ancillary health insurance, as defined in this part and sequential chapters as designated within those chapters.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 6000) #12478, eff 2-12-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins6000.html"
